# Official modules (in the official kernel's modules.order) that ship anyway:
# arc loads them before DSM's own module tree is there. Derived from what the
# prebuilt packages carried (modules/<target>/ on the dev branch). A name a
# platform's kernel does not have, or has built in, is simply skipped.
# Not here: drm, drm_kms_helper, drm_panel_orientation_quirks, i915. Only
# geminilakenk has them officially, and there DSM's own load (a rebuild
# would clash with DSM's i915); elsewhere src/drm-backport ships its own.
